<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O to be like Thee! full of compassion,</l><l>Loving, forgiving, tender and kind,</l><l>Helping the helpless, cheering the fainting,</l><l>Seeking the wand’ring sinners to find.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O to be like Thee! lowly in spirit,</l><l>Holy and harmless, patient and brave;</l><l>Meekly enduring cruel reproaches,</l><l>Willing to suffer, others to save.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>O to be like Thee! Lord, I am coming,</l><l>Now to receive th’ anointing divine;</l><l>All that I am and have I am bringing;</l><l>Lord, from this moment all shall be Thine.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>O to be like Thee! While I am pleading</l><l>Pour out Thy Spirit, fill with Thy love.</l><l>Make me a temple meet for Thy dwelling,</l><l>Fit for a life which Thou wouldst approve.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
